<title>FRANCE: Non-residents net buyers French govt bonds in Sept.</title>
<headline>Non-residents net buyers French govt bonds in Sept.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Figures released on Friday by the finance ministry showed non-residents were net buyers of French government bonds (OATs and BTANs) in September for the first time since November 1995.</p>
<p>The ministry gave the following unadjusted breakdown (in billions of francs) of the financial account in its balance of payment figures.</p>
<p> DIRECT INVESTMENT			     Sep	Aug   Sep 95</p>
<p>  - Direct investment			  0.41     0.29   -8.33</p>
<p>     - French investment abroad	   -6.93    -7.86  -16.85</p>
<p>     - Foreign investment in France	7.34     8.14    8.53</p>
<p> PORTFOLIO INVESTMENT			-26.79   -12.87   -4.74</p>
<p>  - Residents in foreign securities    -20.69     1.40  -17.26</p>
<p>     - shares				   -7.71     1.14    0.01</p>
<p>     - bonds				   -23.97     3.11  -14.55</p>
<p>     - money market instruments	   10.16    -1.48   -3.92</p>
<p>     - derivative products		   0.83    -1.37    1.20</p>
<p>  - Non-residents in French securities  -6.10   -14.27   12.53</p>
<p>     - shares				    0.42    -4.86    0.82</p>
<p>     - bonds				     1.75    -4.91   16.01</p>
<p>	  -Govt securities (OATs, BTANs)   1.89   -14.15   16.96</p>
<p>     - money market instruments	   -8.27    -4.50   -4.30</p>
<p> OTHER INVESTMENTS			    14.60     1.51   16.58</p>
<p>  - Credits				    -40.79    42.09   24.97</p>
<p>  - Liabilities				 55.39   -40.58   -8.39</p>
<p> RESERVE ASSETS				  0.01    -0.17   -0.01</p>
<p> TOTAL FINANCIAL ACCOUNT		   -11.77   -11.25    3.51</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
</text>
